  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0.0,
      "text": "Same woman."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 1.0,
      "text": "Same face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 3.0,
      "text": "So why do these three versions look so different?"
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 5.0,
      "text": "The face is the same."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 7.0,
      "text": "What changes is the structure, the proportions, the details."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 12.0,
      "text": "In version two, a facelift reshapes her lower face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 17.0,
      "text": "A tighter jawline, a more defined profile."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 20.0,
      "text": "The change is structural."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 22.0,
      "text": "Now, the individual features."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 25.0,
      "text": "Brows frame the eyes."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 27.0,
      "text": "The eyes set the expression."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 28.0,
      "text": "The nose balances the midface."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 30.0,
      "text": "Lips shape the lower face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 33.0,
      "text": "Skin and hair change how the whole face reads."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 37.0,
      "text": "None of these exist in isolation."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 40.0,
      "text": "It's how they work together."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 42.0,
      "text": "Now compare all three. The original, the facelift, the refined features."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 47.0,
      "text": "Same woman, three different impressions."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 50.0,
      "text": "And interestingly, the biggest change isn't always the whole face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 53.0,
      "text": "Beauty is subjective. Which do you prefer: one, two, or three?"
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 58.0,
      "text": "Want to understand your own face? Refina's personalized 22-page facial analysis maps your features, your strengths, and what you may want to refine."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 70.0,
      "text": "Discover your face with Refina."
    }
  ],
